# Optional per-client override.
# Only fill this in if THIS client uses a different sequencer account/workspace
# than your default in config/.env — e.g. they pay for their own seat,
# or you run their campaigns out of a separate workspace under your account.
# This can also be a different SEQUENCER entirely than your default, if this
# one client is on a different tool than the rest of your book of business.
#
# To use it: copy this file to "credentials.env" (same folder) and fill in
# whichever fields differ from your defaults. Leave the rest blank —
# skills fall back to config/.env for anything not set here.

PLUSVIBE_API_KEY=
PLUSVIBE_WORKSPACE_ID=
SMARTLEAD_API_KEY=
EMAILBISON_API_KEY=
AI_ARK_API_KEY=
